        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Poffin ingredient. If held by a\nPokémon, it restores the user’s HP in\na pinch, but may also cause confusion.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "diamond-pearl",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/8/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A Poffin ingredient. If held by a\nPokémon, it restores the user’s HP in\na pinch, but may also cause confusion.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "platinum",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/9/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "If held by a Pokémon, it restores the\nuser’s HP in a pinch, but may cause\nconfusion if it hates sour food.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "heartgold-soulsilver",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/10/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tenue, cette Baie restaure des PV en\ncas de besoin, mais rend confus si\nle Pokémon n’aime pas son goût.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "If held by a Pokémon, it restores the\nuser’s HP in a pinch, but will cause\nconfusion if it hates the taste.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "If held by a Pokémon, it restores the\nuser’s HP in a pinch, but will cause\nconfusion if it hates the taste.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　もたせると\nピンチのとき　ＨＰを　かいふくする。\nきらいな　あじだと　こんらん　する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포켓몬에게 지니게 하면\n위급할 때 HP를 회복한다.\n싫어하는 맛이면 혼란에 빠진다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tenue, cette Baie restaure des PV en cas\nde besoin, mais rend le Pokémon confus si\nson goût lui déplaît.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Als getragenes Item füllt die Beere die KP eines\nPokémon auf, doch ihr Aroma verwirrt jene,\ndie es nicht mögen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una baya muy rara en la región de Teselia.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Se un Pokémon in difficoltà ha questa bacca,\nrecupera dei PS. Se al Pokémon non piace\nil suo sapore, può causare confusione.",
