      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Als getragenes Item füllt die Beere im Notfall die KP\neines Pokémon auf, doch ihr Aroma verwirrt jene,\ndie es nicht mögen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Los Pokémon pueden llevarla o usarla para restaurar\nalgunos PS. Su sabor puede causar confusión si no les\ngusta.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Se un Pokémon in difficoltà ha questa bacca,\nrecupera dei PS. Se al Pokémon non piace\nil suo sapore, può causare confusione.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "If held by a Pokémon, it restores the user’s HP in a\npinch, but it will cause confusion if the user hates\nthe taste.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　持たせると\nピンチのとき　ＨＰを　回復する。\nきらいな味だと　混乱する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "让宝可梦携带后，\n危机时可以回复ＨＰ。\n如果讨厌这味道就会混乱。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Los Pokémon pueden llevarla o usarla para restaurar\nalgunos PS. Su sabor puede causar confusión si no les\ngusta.",
